# Uleguerand - Dominion Op #11 (abyssea 111, op 584): a level 99 Warrior in Abyssea - Uleguerand; the op's target
# Ermit_Imp (23 placed spawns, the first 17813545). The next op (#12, Benumbed_Vodoriga) and Altepa's and Grauberg's #11
# accepted (a GM), this op available: an Ermit_Imp killed: no section: nothing. This op accepted (a GM;
# activeDominionOp stays 0, which dominionOnMobDeath does not read): an Ermit_Imp killed: dominionOnMobDeath(584):
# Quest[8][111]Prog 1 (FOV_DEFEATED_TARGET 1 of 5). The next op's Benumbed_Vodoriga killed: Quest[8][112]Prog 1 (its own
# count), this op's unchanged. Prog 4 (a GM): one more: Prog 5 (5 of 5); another: the count is full (numDefeated < 5 is
# false): nothing. Completed (Prog 0, as completeDominionOp leaves it; a GM): another killed: no section: nothing.
# Abyssea - Uleguerand's IDs.lua names no mob, so each kill names its mob by id (kill #<id>). Perfect Dodge, Invincible
# and Elemental Sforzo (GM effects) keep the chars alive through the kills (the Abyssea mobs aggro and link).
lists AbysseaUleguerand/Ermit_Imp/onMobDeath AbysseaUleguerand/Benumbed_Vodoriga/onMobDeath
char zone=AbysseaUleguerand pos=-240,-40,-520 job=WAR lvl=99
login
effect 49                               # a GM: Perfect Dodge (melee hits evaded)
effect 50                               # a GM: Invincible (no physical damage)
effect 522                              # a GM: Elemental Sforzo (no magic damage)
quest Abyssea.DominionOp12Uleguerand accepted # a GM: the next op
quest Abyssea.DominionOp11Altepa accepted # a GM: Altepa's #11
quest Abyssea.DominionOp11Grauberg accepted # a GM: Grauberg's #11
kill #17813545                          # available: nothing
quest Abyssea.DominionOp11Uleguerand accepted # a GM
kill #17813546                          # accepted: Prog 1
kill #17813569                          # Benumbed_Vodoriga: Quest[8][112]Prog 1
charvar Quest[8][111]Prog 4             # a GM
kill #17813547                          # Prog 5
kill #17813548                          # full: nothing
quest Abyssea.DominionOp11Uleguerand completed # a GM
charvar Quest[8][111]Prog 0             # a GM
kill #17813549                          # completed: nothing
